
%define app_id io.github.levinsv.pgadmin3

Name: pgadmin3
Version: 1.27.0
Release: alt1

Summary: Administration and development platform for the PostgreSQL

Group: Databases
License: BSD
# Originally https://github.com/pgadmin-org/pgadmin3, switch to fork with current PG support
URL: https://github.com/levinsv/pgadmin3
VCS: https://github.com/levinsv/pgadmin3.git

# Source-url: https://github.com/levinsv/pgadmin3/archive/refs/tags/v%version.tar.gz
Source: %name-%version.tar

BuildRequires(pre): rpm-macros-cmake
BuildRequires: cmake
BuildRequires: gcc-c++
BuildRequires: postgresql18
BuildRequires: libxslt-devel
BuildRequires: libwxGTK3.2-devel
BuildRequires: libxml2-devel
BuildRequires: desktop-file-utils

%description
This fork of pgAdmin III is for administering and developing PostgreSQL databases,
available for any use.
The application runs on GNU/Linux and Windows 2010.
This version of pgAdmin III is designed with extensive administration and development
 capabilities - from writing simple SQL queries to developing complex databases.
The graphical interface supports most PostgreSQL functions and simplifies administration.
The application also includes an SQL editor, a server code editor, log processing, and much more.

%prep
%setup

%build
%cmake_build

%install
%cmake_install

%files
%_bindir/%name
%_datadir/%name/
%_desktopdir/pgadmin3.desktop
%_iconsdir/pgadmin3.svg
